<h1><%= @character.name %></h1>

<p class="tag">Max HP: <strong><%= @character.max_hp %></strong></p>

<h2>Damage by where the shell lands</h2>
<ul class="card-list">
  <li><span>Dead centre</span><strong><%= Battle::DAMAGE_BANDS[0].last %></strong></li>
  <li><span>Mid hull</span><strong><%= Battle::DAMAGE_BANDS[1].last %></strong></li>
  <li><span>Treads</span><strong><%= Battle::DAMAGE_BANDS[2].last %></strong></li>
  <li><span>Shrapnel, 1 unit out</span><strong><%= Battle::DAMAGE_BANDS[3].last %></strong></li>
  <li><span>Shrapnel, 2 units out</span><strong><%= Battle::DAMAGE_BANDS[4].last %></strong></li>
</ul>

<p class="back-link"><%= link_to "← Back to battles", battles_path %></p>
